        name: "Corporate Asset",
        description: "Field agent for a megacorporation. You have a corporate corvette, high credit reserves, and access to restricted markets. But corporate life comes with strings — multiple factions view your employer with suspicion, and your standing with independent groups suffers. Your corporate credentials open doors, but they also paint a target on your back.",
